.TH FERDIM-GUI 1 "2026-11-23" "ferdim 1.4.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ferdim-gui \- GTK 4 front-end for the FerDim download manager
.SH DESCRIPTION
Desktop application showing the FerDim download queue with per-job controls
and a maximum-power toggle. The add dialog accepts a URL, optional mirrors,
an optional checksum and a "start immediately" switch; icon-only buttons
carry accessible names and labels are keyboard mnemonics, so the window is
fully usable with a screen reader. Talks to the
.BR ferdim (1)
daemon over its local socket and starts it on demand. Requires
python3-gobject.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ferdim (1)
